WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.979
Today, Mom is taking me to the big city.

2
00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:14.787
I'm visiting my dad!

3
00:00:14.788 --> 00:00:20.155
It's very sunny!

4
00:00:20.156 --> 00:00:22.746
So I wear sunscreen.

5
00:00:22.747 --> 00:00:31.134
It protects my skin.

6
00:00:31.135 --> 00:00:36.449
I'm in the car.

7
00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:38.834
So I wear a seat belt.

8
00:00:38.835 --> 00:00:44.599
It protects my body.

9
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:48.074
It's very bright!

10
00:00:48.075 --> 00:00:50.802
So I wear sunglasses.

11
00:00:50.803 --> 00:00:58.685
They protect my eyes.

12
00:00:58.686 --> 00:01:02.605
It's very dangerous!

13
00:01:02.606 --> 00:01:05.594
So I wear a hard hat.

14
00:01:05.595 --> 00:01:12.133
It protects my head.

15
00:01:12.134 --> 00:01:15.695
It's very dusty!

16
00:01:15.696 --> 00:01:18.479
So I wear a mask.

17
00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:23.976
It protects my throat.

18
00:01:23.977 --> 00:01:30.628
It's very high!

19
00:01:30.629 --> 00:01:34.237
So my dad holds my hand.

20
00:01:34.238 --> 00:01:37.525
He protects me.

21
00:01:37.526 --> 00:01:47.326
Wow! The city is very beautiful!

